<title>SRI LANKA: Forbes Ceylon 12-mth net soars 681 pct.</title>
<headline>Forbes Ceylon 12-mth net soars 681 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31</p>
<p>	 (in millions of rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>			     1997	     1996</p>
<p>    Turnover	    776.98   vs    866.54</p>
<p>    Net profit	   88.59   vs     11.34</p>
<p>    Tax		    47.58   vs     33.59</p>
<p>NOTE - Results are unaudited. Forbes Ceylon Ltd is a holding company with interests in commodity and stock broking, plantation management, exports and real estate.</p>
